# Encounter overrides for the Nar Shaddaa docks. This is our own data,
# read by crates/session/src/encounters.rs. It is never written into the
# game install.
#
# TSLRCM's ambush after T3-M4's warehouse mission (k_303_zattack, which
# only TSLRCM ships) locks every door in the docks, including the
# flophouse door to Mira's apartment. That door is the apartment's only
# way out, and the ambush starts while the party is still inside. A party
# inside with the door closed could never leave (QUIRKS.md Q-0721,
# https://github.com/kjk-engine/kjk/issues/555). The owner approved this
# fix on 2026-11-18. The ambush still locks every other door.
spare_lock Flophouse_Secret k_303_zattack
